 for your life</strong>: Soldiers are hunting you with maximum aggression and unearthly horrors stalk your every move.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lock and Load:</strong> Use a variety of upgradable weaponry to survive close quarter fights in destructible environments.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity Under Siege:</strong> Keep your wits as you face nightmarish visions and creatures.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets of the Deep</strong>: Explore the remains of research stations, investigating emails, PDA\u2019s and survivor accounts to unravel a dark conspiracy.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Camel 101"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593230/6743ed140821b639877f7560f19db9eabde077e3/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760371654","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Beneath \u00a9 2025 Camel 101. Published by Wired Productions Ltd and developed by Camel 101. Beneath and the Beneath logo are trademarks of Camel 101. All rights reserved.\u00a0","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1593230/729071619/c7c01d065145d8c99abb4bc5a556c835c4351e73/1760348116/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760362778","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1593230/729071619/c7c01d065145d8c99abb4bc5a556c835c4351e73/1760348116/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760362778","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1593230/729071619/c7